Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He weaseled his way into this tournament\Njust to publicly humiliate Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he did have his reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but when he started\Nendangering people's lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried stepped over the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys think all that stuff about Kaiba\Nstealing Siegfried's invention is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.15,0:01:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he seemed pretty bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.01,0:01:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may be competitive,\Nbut he's not a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His accomplishments are a result\Nof his drive and determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Siegfried has been\Nblinded by his own jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent his entire life trying to outdo\NKaiba, but he was always one step behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.25,0:01:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome dueling out there, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,defeating that wannabe sent\Nthe message to the rest of our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,competitors that Kaiba Corp is\Nnot a company to be messed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because next time, I'm not\Ngoing to be so friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, let's move on. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Announce the start of\Nthe championship matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, shall I have security\Nremove Siegfried from the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.89,0:02:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him to see what he missed out on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So give him a good seat for the next duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.65,0:02:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've\Nall been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The final match of the Grand\NChampionship Featuring the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy Wonder and Semifinal\NChamp is Leapin' Leon Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll face up against the\Nreigning International Duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Champion. None other than The\NKing of Games himself, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a duel to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The championship bout is about to begin\Nin Kyberland's Blue Eyes Fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be so awesome You totally
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,hooked us up with the\Nbest seats in the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, it was nothing. Let's\Njust say I know some people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,who know some people in these\Nparts Maybe if you're lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you backstage\Nto meet the stars Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you really are a big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the match is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to cheer the\Nloudest for my Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Pharaoh, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have to admit, with our title\Non the line, I'm a little bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember to stay focused\Nand most of all, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi-O!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely day for a duel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you brought everything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It might bring you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to what may be the most\Nanticipated duel ever played.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The final bout of the\NCasey Grand Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give it up for our current\Ntitle holder, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now a challenger and very\Nold boy wonder, Leon Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought long and hard to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always been my\Ndream to meet you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I have, I've\Ngot myself a new dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The opponents have started talking trash,\Nwhich means the duel is ready to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will be the champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon Wilson, or Yugi Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, to kick off the festivities,\Nplease welcome a very special individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's talking about my\Nbrother, not you, you nimrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.35,0:05:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A man without whom none\Nof this could take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The host of the KC Grand\NChampionship Tournament, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to Kaiba to make this\Nwhole tournament all about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he did organize it and pay for\Nit and build the theme park to host it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd say it is all about him. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,in fact, now that I think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the only thing that Kaiba didn't\Ndo in this tournament is duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you, he wanted to participate\Nin this tournament more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was too busy opening Kaiba\NLand and proving our company's image.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who really\Ndeserves to face Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know if\NI go that far, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could have been a contender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you lost your first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, almost beat Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's got the title shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if my brother dueled in\Nthis tournament from the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,he would have blown you all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The KC Grand Championship Tournament\Nwas designed with one thing in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding the only person\Nbesides myself who deserves
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to be called the greatest\Nduelist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So these two competitors will face off in\None final battle to determine just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, start the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start off with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.09,0:07:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my ferocious forest\Nwolf in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A wolf in Grandma's clothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That card's bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll begin by activating a\Nmagic card known as Polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it to fuse two\Nof my monsters together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So Gazelle and Murpmont\Njoin forces to form Chimera,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the flying mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Chimera attack his forest wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's afraid of the\Nbig bad wolf? Not Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is all a big joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited my entire life for the\Nchance to face off against Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So you might say I'm not taking this\Nduel too lightly if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to win and win big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll start with my most\Ndevastating creature yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I noticed, but\Nisn't that little red riding hood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Leon still likes fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you guys don't\Neven know the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how tough can they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say they're not the sweet\Nlittle characters you guys remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of not being\Nsweet, what's up with Leon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ever since this duel started,\Nhe's been acting like a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,For once, I agree with you dorks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been watching the competitors\Nclosely since the tournament began.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And something definitely seems\Ndifferent about that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, are you thinking\Nwhat I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that Leon doesn't seem to\Nbe acting like himself out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he does seem a bit\Nangry, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You think the pressure is getting to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But now the duel must go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I miss it? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's gonna go ballistic\Nwhen he hears this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon obnoxious Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Little Red Riding\NHood with Celtic Blade Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I never liked that story anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,These fairy tale freaks are nothing\Ncompared to Yu-Gi's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure of that, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of Leon's monsters comes\Nwith an annoying little twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for Little Red Riding\NHood's little twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once she's destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm allowed to transfer\Nany level 4 warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,monster from my deck\Ndirectly to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my forest hunter in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Like most of my monsters, forest\Nhunter comes with a special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And his lets him remove\None beast or beast warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,monster from the game\Nbefore he even attacks you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Forest hunter, eliminate Chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon pulled out all these weird\Ntricks when he duels against me also.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will say he definitely seemed to\Nbe having more fun than he is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But what changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dueling for the\Nchampionship title now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.55,0:11:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Being nervous about a\Nbig duel is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but acting like a total creep is another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon said he's been waiting\Nto duel Yugi for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'd think he'd at least\Ncrack a smile out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.01,0:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, I shall end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know something, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I first saw you duel,\Nyou've been like a role model to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I dreamed about one day facing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that it's happening,\NI can't even enjoy myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.85,0:11:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you've got to\Ntake a look at this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Something was fishy in Leon's profile,\Nso I ran another background check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me this is some kind of a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's true, Herr Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the final part\Nof your twisted plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it took you long\Nenough to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing away your own\Nlife wasn't good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so you had to drag your\Nown brother down with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon Wilson is, in reality,\Nmy younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon von Schroeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat is out of the bag, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to reveal the real\Nreason you entered this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so these two are brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was make you believe that\NI was the real threat in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so intent on stopping me,\Nyou were blinded from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,while you were foolishly exhausting your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,resources trying to\Nuncover the truth about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my brother was quietly climbing the ranks\Nof this competition virtually unopposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Avon Schroeder\Nis about to win it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your biggest rival is about to reign\Nvictorious in your own tournament, Herr Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And the timing couldn't be\Nbetter since SchroederCorp
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is about to release our new gaming system!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just imagine the publicity my new game will\Nget When my brother defeats the king of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,games himself You mean you sabotaged my\Ntournament just to sell a few lousy games?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's anyone who knows\Nabout lousy games, it's you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Herr Kyber, you've had\Nyour moment at the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so now it's time for\Nyou to step aside And as
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,soon as my brother is\Ncrowned world champions,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The new age of Srodokop will begin.\NThis duel's not over yet, sick freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yugi won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I stop the duel, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you disqualify Leon now, you'll be\Nbreaking the rules of your own competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Duels in progress can't be stopped. Plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,if you pull the plug\Nbefore a champion is named,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:14:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,then your entire tournament was nothing\Nmore than a giant waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's only one man's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You do what you think is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a little problem\Nwith your plan, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one duelist in the entire\Nworld who's talented enough to defeat Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And as I see it, your plan\Nonly works if he loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again, I guess that's only\None man's opinion, isn't it, Siegfried?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd say your brother\Nhas as much of a shot at
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,winning as your company\Ndoes of ever succeeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now that was pretty low.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This championship duel will\Nnow continue as scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And may the best duelist win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected anyone to defeat\Nyou in this tournament, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That honor will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is time to prove your\Nworth as a ventruder and crush
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto just like we\Nrehearsed it a thousand times!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, who knew Ziggy\Nwas such a stage mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That means everything\NLeon said to us about his
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,dreams of becoming a champion\Nduelist was one big lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Leon, are you really\Nhere to destroy Kaiba Corp?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you letting your\Nbrother control who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth will set you free!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.47,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let these do-gooders\Nturn you against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They will never understand what\Nour family has been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go ahead and crush\NYugi Moto so you can obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the championship title\Nyou so rightfully deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your duty as a Schroeder.\NI know. Hold on. Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know what you\Nwere just about to say, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That dueling in order\Nto get revenge is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But my brother never\Nasked for my help before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and now for the first\Ntime ever, he needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I can remember, Siegfried was\Nthe most important member of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ziggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this new fairy\Ntale book I just got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother your brother, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for his lessons\Nnow, and he must concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remember, Siegfried,\Nyou must study very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father can't run\NSchrodercorp forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and someday our family\Nbusiness will be in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, see to it that your brother\Nisn't distracted by all of your noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't make a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With everyone's attention focused on\NSiegfried, I was pretty much forgotten about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I learned to entertain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent most of my time\Nreading fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but part of me still wished there was\Nsomething I could do to help my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I discovered the game of Duel\NMonsters, and my life was never the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I just had a knack for dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner is Leon Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I changed my name so my\Nfamily wouldn't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to congratulate you\Non your latest victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,hacking into tournament\Ncomputer systems and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,creating phony identities\Nlike a little secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew you were so devious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You know there's no way they\Nwould understand, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I love dueling more than\Nanything, so I did whatever it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to explain yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that I'm finally getting\Nthe chance to bond with my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me rephrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My talented little brother, who seems to\Npossess all sorts of hidden abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Abilities he should be using to help his\Nbig brother run their family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me? You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you have a gift that could help thrust\NSchroeder Corp straight up to number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me whatever you need, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything to be a\Npart of our family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you'll never be alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not just fighting for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting for my whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So Leon was brainwashed into dueling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He should play for his love of the\Ngame, not his family's vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, he knows that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:19:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll start things off by\Nsummoning this card, Iron Hans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all, because once\Nthis monster's on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it allows me to automatically\Nsummon my Iron Knight as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to step down, because\Nthere's a new champion in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.99,0:19:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and his name is Leon Bon Schroeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon my Iron Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you wouldn't let me down, Leon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one monster and I have\Nthree So before this turn is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your former title will\Nbelong to Schroderkorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yola, Yola, Yola, Yola!
